    "summary": "T15 commits912d4b96d,5efb0b4cc,6a8437b69. All prior gate findings corrected: node/text/manifest encoders use memory.allocate exact-size backing and UTF8 writes through zero-copy ArrayBuffer views, never pooled Buffer.from(string). Regression prohibits pooled string-buffer construction throughout add/seal. Source session close removes disk/cache only; decoded results remain usable and fully charged until explicit releaseResult, even after close. Dedicated post-close result-lifetime test proves ownership stays charged through final consumer release. All previous pre-allocation source encoder/decoder, raw batch, inventory/request metadata, staged read and result ownership corrections remain.58 affected cases and npm build pass locally. Defaults and retained T14 scope/gates unchanged; T16-T20 still own incremental packet and lifecycle consumer conversion and final production cutover. No deployment, old review resume or end-to-end T14 success claimed.",
